    "body": "-μα nouns have a -ματ- stem (πνεῦμα, πνεύματος, plural πνεύματα). -ος neuters (ἔθνος, ὄρος) look masculine but take τό and have a -ους genitive and an -η plural: τὰ ἔθνη, the nations. Neuter rule still holds: nominative = accusative.",
